00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:34.000
klasifikasi, dan respons insidennya sendiri.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.320
Koneksi langsung mengurangi eksposur kepatuhan

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.940
